     "title": "سورة التكوير",
     "html": "<div class=\"quran qx\" data-q=\"81:1-29\" data-h=\"1-29\"><div class=\"qbasm\">بِسْمِ ࡴ۬للَّهِ ࡴ۬لرَّحْمَٰنِ ࡴ۬لرَّحِيمِ</div><span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"1\" data-h=\"1-1\">إِذَا ࡰ۬لشَّمْسُ كُوِّرَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"2\" data-h=\"2-2\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لنُّجُومُ ࡲٜنكَدَرَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"3\" data-h=\"3-3\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لْجِبَالُ سُيِّرَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٣﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"4\" data-h=\"4-4\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لْعِشَارُ عُطِّلَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٤﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"5\" data-h=\"5-5\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لْوُحُوشُ حُشِرَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٥﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"6\" data-h=\"6-6\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لْبِحَارُ سُجِّرَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٦﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"7\" data-h=\"7-7\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لنُّفُوسُ زُوِّجَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٧﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"8\" data-h=\"8-8\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لْمَوْءُۥدَةُ سُئِلَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٨﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"9\" data-h=\"9-9\">بِأَيِّ ذَنۢبࣲ قُتِلَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٩﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"10\" data-h=\"10-10\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لصُّحُفُ نُشِرَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٠﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"11\" data-h=\"11-11\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لسَّمَآءُ كُشِطَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١١﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"12\" data-h=\"12-12\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لْجَحِيمُ سُعِّرَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٢﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"13\" data-h=\"13-13\">وَإِذَا ࡰ۬لْجَنَّةُ أُزْلِفَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٣﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"14\" data-h=\"14-14\">عَلِمَتْ نَفْسࣱ مَّا أَحْضَرَتْ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٤﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"15\" data-h=\"15-15\">فَلَا أُقْسِمُ بِالْخُنَّسِ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٥﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"16\" data-h=\"16-16\">ࡴ۬لْجَوَارِ ࡴ۬لْكُنَّسِ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٦﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"17\" data-h=\"17-17\">وَاليْلِ إِذَا عَسْعَسَ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٧﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"18\" data-h=\"18-18\">وَالصُّبْحِ إِذَا تَنَفَّسَ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٨﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"19\" data-h=\"19-19\">إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلُ رَسُولࣲ كَرِيمࣲ <span class=\"qn\">﴿١٩﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"20\" data-h=\"20-20\">ذِے قُوَّةٍ عِندَ ذِے ࡴ۬لْعَرْشِ مَكِينࣲ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢٠﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"21\" data-h=\"21-21\">مُّطَاعࣲ ثَمَّ أَمِينࣲ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢١﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"22\" data-h=\"22-22\">وَمَا صَٰحِبُكُم بِمَجْنُونࣲ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢٢﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"23\" data-h=\"23-23\">وَلَقَدْ رَءَاهُ بِالْأُفُقِ ࡴ۬لْمُبِينِ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢٣﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"24\" data-h=\"24-24\">وَمَا هُوَ عَلَى ࡰ۬لْغَيْبِ بِضَنِينࣲ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢٤﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"25\" data-h=\"25-25\">وَمَا هُوَ بِقَوْلِ شَيْطَٰنࣲ رَّجِيمࣲ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢٥﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"26\" data-h=\"26-26\">فَأَيْنَ تَذْهَبُونَ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢٦﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"27\" data-h=\"27-27\">إِنْ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكْرࣱ لِّلْعَٰلَمِينَ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢٧﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"28\" data-h=\"28-28\">لِمَن شَآءَ مِنكُمْ أَنْ يَّسْتَقِيمَ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢٨﴾</span></span> <span class=\"qa\" data-a=\"29\" data-h=\"29-29\">وَمَا تَشَآءُونَ إِلَّا أَنْ يَّشَآءَ ࡰ۬للَّهُ رَبُّ ࡲ۬لْعَٰلَمِينَ <span class=\"qn\">﴿٢٩﴾</span></span></div><p class=\"note\">📿 اضغط «استمع بصوت القارئ» أو على أي آية لتسمع التلاوة برواية قالون عن نافع.</p>"
